		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Ethereal specter with long- fingered, blood-red hands. Tormented, undead puppeteer created from the soul of one who dies from transgressing a taboo.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 40, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 touch +6 (3d6) or malevolence, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> -3, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 9</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Incorporeal</strong>. In place of attacks, become corporeal or incorporeal.</p><p></p><p><strong>Malevolence</strong>. Must be corporeal. One mortal target, close range. Contested CHA check. If dybbuk wins, it inhabits target's body and controls it for 1d8 days.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
